=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  timesync no-service ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13$
# with no time service: a warning, and Set servers is$
# unavailable. hardn installs none.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [ ] NTP                  Review ~ no time service$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Service              None$
  [ ] Clock                Not in sync$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          No time service$
                           [-] Unavailable$
   2) Refresh              Read the host again$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0, 2 or q]:$
$
$

